    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>As your mastery deepens, the Traveler's more demanding techniques open to you. You automatically gain these combo actions at the listed levels &mdash; no feats required:</p><ul><li><strong>6th</strong> The Gnashing combo: @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.bf44b0d50715c762]{Gnashing Fang} → @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.c92a9a4f65aed576]{Savage Claw} → @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.901295e96cdc5cc2]{Wicked Talon}, plus their @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.141e49ccd412a33a]{Continuation} follow-ups (@UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.84d4d65427e30457]{Jugular Rip}, @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.d2e7e82195b0d940]{Abdomen Tear}, @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.46135863d5cb73ef]{Eye Gouge}).</li><li><strong>12th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.2d1c8118880acda4]{Fated Circle} and its follow-up @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.11009f00b5d265be]{Fated Brand}.</li><li><strong>14th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.gunbreaker-pf2e.gunbreaker-class.Item.9165ace5282778b5]{Double Down}, your two-cartridge ultimate.</li></ul><p>(The follow-ups become usable once you also have Continuation, gained at 7th level.)</p>",
